      "writtenOn": "2025-08-07T13:47:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having to run 5 different commands in the right order rather than one seems like a step backwards. Shouldn\u0027t the integration script take care of all this, so it\u0027s a single command?",
      "revId": "6c7d06cb33265f82a97719c5aaf74f8681bc3a21",
