      "message": "Btw can we reduce the commands to these?\n```\n# Build RF-A and STF\nmake PLAT\u003dfvp DEBUG\u003d1 all\n\n# Build BL1 and BL2 from TF-A, and create the FIP.\nmake -C $TFA PLAT\u003dfvp FVP_TRUSTED_SRAM_SIZE\u003d512 SPD\u003dspmd SPMD_SPM_AT_SEL2\u003d0 DEBUG\u003d1 \\\n    BL31\u003d\"$(pwd)/target/bl31.bin\" BL32\u003d\"$(pwd)/target/bl32.bin\" BL33\u003d\"$(pwd)/target/bl33.bin\" all fip\n\n# Launch on FVP\nmake PLAT\u003dfvp DEBUG\u003d1 fvp\n```",
